@startuml
title Регистрация нового пользователя

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant UI as "LoginPage (Flutter UI)"
participant AuthCtrl as "AuthController"
participant RegisterUC as "RegisterUseCase"
participant AuthRepo as "AuthRepositoryImpl"
participant AuthApi as "AuthApi"
participant API as "FastAPI /auth/register"
database DB as "PostgreSQL"
participant Security as "Security (hash/JWT)"
participant Storage as "TokenStorage\n(Flutter Secure Storage)"
participant Router as "GoRouter"

User -> UI: Вводит email/password/displayName\nнажимает "Регистрация"
UI -> AuthCtrl: register(email, password, displayName)
AuthCtrl -> RegisterUC: call(email, password, displayName)
RegisterUC -> AuthRepo: register(...)
AuthRepo -> AuthApi: register(...)
AuthApi -> API: POST /auth/register

activate API
API -> Security: hash_password(password)\nnew_refresh_token()\ncreate_access_token()
Security --> API: password_hash + refresh_token + access_token
API -> DB: INSERT users/auth_identities/refresh_tokens
DB --> API: user_id сохранен
API --> AuthApi: AuthResponse(access_token,\naccess_expires_at, refresh_token)
deactivate API

AuthApi --> AuthRepo: AuthTokens
AuthRepo --> RegisterUC: AuthTokens
RegisterUC --> AuthCtrl: AuthTokens
AuthCtrl -> Storage: write(tokens)
Storage --> AuthCtrl: ok
AuthCtrl --> UI: state = authenticated
UI -> Router: redirect("/map")
Router --> User: Открыт экран карты

@enduml
